  "document": "A Day for Lionhearts\nUn giorno da leoni( internationally released as A Day for Lionhearts) is a 1961 Italian war- drama film directed by Nanni Loy. The film describes the gradual evolution towards anti-fascism of Italian people during the Second World War."
